      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今年与她同期的，皆是备受瞩目的选手，\n为求谨慎，她将挑战“京成杯”，\n以在经典三冠竞赛中跑出成果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c153453f35d563e6468f7cdc74806b55b07268e59630e45280c923416dad444",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
