    {
      "uid": "zhcn:699f52d4d90585a26bdcd12c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在“皋月赏”也顺利留下成果，\n荣进闪耀接着鼓起干劲\n挑战“日本德比”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2c17fef1551d89ffca8ae25cd07a0f4276958fb4a7cd185e5298d6486005b90",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1037/storytimeline_501037423.json",
      "json_path": [
