      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1037/storytimeline_501037423.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed73f9212b7a183dd226b9f4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "每周都进行与正式比赛强度相同的模拟赛，\n借此累积“经验”，\n但这将对身体造成过度负担。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d81edfc0f36a07ac412bfc95255fb892f44e8a32d75f30732b2ff9a30cec210b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1037/storytimeline_501037423.json",
      "json_path": [
