      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "荣进闪耀沉浸在胜利的喜悦中。\n看到女儿达成如此“厉害”的成就，\n她的父母也相当为她高兴。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0bce586d925f79631c78396530759d1970cee56750b1bd99078b9b8efd4f1b7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
