      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她重新体悟到自己对于胜利的渴求。\n两人本来说好要继续这样，\n按照计划跑完每一场比赛──",
      "source_fingerprint": "3cad6a37d4b91e8184f3f72034d33a47859cb7a33ec8cf223fc0c211c939fd4e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1037/storytimeline_501037424.json",
      "json_path": [
